window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Abandoned by her mother, raised as a thief by her father and his clan of Irish American Travelers, nineteen-year-old Quinn is jailed for theft.</p> <p></p> <p>Prison, followed by probation at an equestrian farm, separate from her gypsy family for the first time. Inspired by spirit of the horses and the estate’s beauty, she believes she can find a better way of life. But the farm’s owner is brutally murdered, and Quinn becomes the prime suspect.</p> <p></p> <p>Can she trust the handsome convict who tries to help her?</p> <p></p> <p>Can she find the real killer before she’s imprisoned for life or murdered because she knows too much?</p>"; 
